Codex Jev Compaction is inspired by fast-jev-compaction by Tamara Tran:
https://github.com/tamaratran/fast-jev-compaction

Design and selection semantics were studied from commit
e3f262a7f4d42bd8dd32ced30d26176f7cb545b0, licensed under the MIT License.

This project is an independent Codex hook implementation. It does not copy or
modify Codex transcripts; it creates a separate, bounded checkpoint before
Codex compaction and provides that checkpoint as additional context afterward.
